WEBVTT

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:12.480
You press Preview. Even a
small app is made of about

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:18.100
2700 modules. Only 26 of
them are the ones you built.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.190
The classic preview rebuilt all of it.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.550
Every time you changed anything.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.790
So new preview flips it around.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.470
Build only what's yours.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.500
Everything WaveMaker ships
is the same for every app.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.320
So it's prepared once, and every
project simply links to it.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.720
Your app is cut into layers
by how often they change.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.720
Edit a page, and only the
top layers are rebuilt.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.900
And your browser only downloads
the pieces that changed.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.790
Make a change and keep your preview open.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:13.450
In a few seconds, it updates itself
without reloading the page

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.120
and it tells you when it's ready.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:22.510
New preview is on by default.

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:26.490
And a few settings in your apps
config file let you shape it.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.880
Big app. Set all pages to false and preview
builds just the pages you're working on.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:38.490
Open another page and it's
built when you get there.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Add a list of pages to
keep them always built.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.150
Prefer to refresh yourself.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.270
Turn live reload off and
the preview waits for you.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.070
While a build runs, the preview
checks on it every two seconds.

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:59.050
Set the poll interval to check less often.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.130
And when the tab is
hidden, it stops checking.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.190
Mix them however your project needs.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:11.570
If you ever need the classic
preview, one line takes you back.

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:16.270
Preview 2.0. Build only what's yours.
